Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:16:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] The brief-inventory API, round 2: the gate's findings 1 and 2
 (cont6's inventory)

- CodeParser: `codeSkipRepeat_zero`, `codeSkipRepeat_succ` (both `rfl`), the repetition's two
  cases, which cont6's generic link reads (finding 1).
- CounterLoop: the five field equations of `RoundContract.counterLoopDone` and
  `RoundContract.counterLoopEscape` (`simps!`, `isSimp := false`), which cont6's round-contract
  route reads; only their `_traj` theorems were published (finding 2).

The review sub-agent's `repair.patch`, applied unchanged. Declarations only; no `@[simp]`.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
